You have learned to find and hit weak spots. All your strikes have a [2.3%, 4.4%, 5.8%, 6.7%, 7.5% (TL1-5)] greater chance to be critical hits, and your critical hits do [7.5%, 13%, 16%, 18%, 20% (TL1-5)] more damage.

Also, when using knives and throwing knives, you now use your Cunning instead of your Strength for bonus damage.
